      <folder name="NAF Metamodel" id="id-a751609f8b1744fab0db370412e34009">
        <folder name="Application Components" id="id-920bbe5cecc4404092bbee6fca73e6df">
          <documentation>NAF Metamodel: Application Component elements, one per specialisation.</documentation>
          <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationComponent" name="Application" id="id-ae95c4ebce044198b597b45380e6c1f1" profiles="id-202278319e5344c39625122b0f3e6093">
            <documentation>A software system as deployed and operated, as opposed to its logical specification. NAF concept (NAF v4.1 ch. 5 Glossary; NAF ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 52), mapped per the template's mapping table.</documentation>
          </element>
          <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationComponent" name="Logical Application" id="id-4c43d8a07fff4af9ad4e228a314f9c10" profiles="id-0b78ace0f4b24440ac74eef920b84676">
            <documentation>An application specified independently of any product or technology. NAF concept (NAF v4.1 ch. 5 Glossary; NAF ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 52), mapped per the template's mapping table.</documentation>
          </element>
        </folder>
        <folder name="Application Functions" id="id-05ecb55eb55849c2bd27b6ba55baddf2">
          <documentation>NAF Metamodel: Application Function elements, one per specialisation.</documentation>
          <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationFunction" name="Application Operation" id="id-f4ebaab9bd4c4c11a8982410bcf3e1bb" profiles="id-034f0dd380b5464e9a944efd30091858">
            <documentation>An operation offered by an application service and invoked through its interface. NAF concept (NAF v4.1 ch. 5 Glossary; NAF ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 52), mapped per the template's mapping table.</documentation>
          </element>
          <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationFunction" name="Resource Function" id="id-f429c987b31047988358f4e62b48e764" profiles="id-3e75f66eba9146fabf3e9a1255c7eeb6">
            <documentation>Behaviour performed by a physical application resource. NAF concept (NAF v4.1 ch. 5 Glossary; NAF ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 52), mapped per the template's mapping table.</documentation>
          </element>
        </folder>
        <documentation>One element per NAF specialisation created in this template (see the mapping table).</documentation>
      </folder>
