            <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-3ac1067bca9243279052de5a71bb689d" textAlignment="1">
              <bounds x="800" y="20" width="460" height="561"/>
              <content>Purpose – Identify the physical resources and the functions they perform, trace them to capabilities, services and logical elements, and organise them in taxonomies.

Concerns – Capability delivery · Service implementation · Resource taxonomies · Applicable protocols · Forecasting technology readiness over time.

Scope – Shall: all relevant physical resources organised in specialisation taxonomies, and the resource functions. May: links between resources and functions; capability configurations; passive resources the resources depend on; traces to capabilities, logical resources, service functions and logical behaviour.

Modelling rules – Each physical resource is assigned to a Resource Function of its own layer. Specialisation and composition relate resources of the same type. A Capability Configuration (Grouping) aggregates resources and realises capabilities. A physical resource specialises the logical resource of the same type, or is associated with it otherwise. A logical or service function aggregates the resource functions that implement it. Protocols and readiness levels are recorded in the `Protocol` and `Readiness Level` properties.

Deviations from the NAF ArchiMate guide – Resource Function: functions instead of processes (direct assignment per layer); Protocol and Readiness Level: properties; physical-to-logical trace restricted to specialisation (same type) or association.

View location – Views / &lt;n Level> / [&lt;Scope>] / P Physical Resource Specifications / P1 &lt;Subject>.</content>
            </child>
            <documentation>Identifies the physical resources and the functions they perform, traces them to capabilities, services and logical elements, and organises them in taxonomies.</documentation>
            <property key="NAF Viewpoint" value="P1"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Row" value="P – Physical Resource Specifications"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Column" value="1 – Taxonomy"/>
            <property key="NAF Steps" value="AV, AD, AE, AG"/>
            <property key="ArchiMate Viewpoint" value="Physical"/>
            <property key="Reference" value="NAF v4.1 ch. 3 (P1); NAF v4.1 ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 33"/>
          </element>
        </folder>
