            <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-fb54f6345e894477992505f22b40f74b" targetConnections="id-29d5e6d6fd5e416895dfc4891568f9d5" archimateElement="id-8c35dea64ad64af986842d136379a7da">
              <bounds x="590" y="180" width="150" height="55"/>
            </child>
            <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-920841f88f2a4173859c6c0eaeff8e7f" textAlignment="1">
              <bounds x="800" y="20" width="460" height="442"/>
              <content>Purpose – Show the evolution timeline of the architecture work products towards the enterprise's goals.

Concerns – Management of architecture projects · Developing architectures.

Scope – Shall: the status of the architecture work products; the architecture milestones that set this status. May: the architecture projects scheduling the milestones; the versions of the work products; the correspondence with milestones of rows C, L and P.

Modelling rules – Architecture Projects (Work Package) realise Architecture Work Products (Deliverable) and trigger Architecture Milestones (Implementation Event). The status reached at a milestone is the work product's `Architecture Status` property. Versions are Git tags (see A6).

Deviations from the NAF ArchiMate guide – Architecture Status: property; Architecture Version: Git; Architecture Work Product: Deliverable instead of Product; milestone → enterprise phase: triggering instead of association.

View location – Views / &lt;n Level> / [&lt;Scope>] / A Architecture Meta-Data / Ar &lt;Subject>.</content>
            </child>
            <documentation>Shows how the architecture work products evolve over time, through milestones and architecture projects.</documentation>
            <property key="NAF Viewpoint" value="Ar"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Row" value="A – Architecture Meta-Data"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Column" value="r – Roadmap"/>
            <property key="NAF Steps" value="AV, MP, AG"/>
            <property key="ArchiMate Viewpoint" value="Implementation and Migration"/>
            <property key="Reference" value="NAF v4.1 ch. 3 (Ar); NAF v4.1 ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 51"/>
          </element>
        </folder>
        <documentation>One guide view per NAF viewpoint of the template, named by its code. Build each enterprise view according to its guide.</documentation>
      </folder>
